CONTRACT NO. _________
ORDINANCE NO. _________

ENTITLED: “AN ORDINANCE GRANTING A FRANCHISE BY THE CITY OF
CHEYENNE TO CHEYENNE LIGHT, FUEL AND POWER COMPANY, ITS
SUCCESSORS AND ASSIGNS, THE RIGHT TO FURNISH, SELL AND
DISTRIBUTE ELECTRICITY TO THE CITY AND TO ALL PERSONS,
BUSINESSES, AND INDUSTRY WITHIN A PORTION OF THE CITY IN
CHEYENNE LIGHT, FUEL AND POWER COMPANY’S CERTIFICATED
TERRITORY AND THE RIGHT TO ACQUIRE, CONSTRUCT, INSTALL,
LOCATE, MAINTAIN, OPERATE AND EXTEND INTO, WITHIN AND
THROUGH SAID CITY ALL FACILITIES REASONABLY NECESSARY TO
FURNISH, SELL AND DISTRIBUTE ELECTRICITY WITHIN THE CITY
AND THE RIGHT TO MAKE REASONABLE USE OF ALL STREETS AND
OTHER PUBLIC PLACES AND PUBLIC EASEMENTS AS HEREIN
DEFINED AS MAY BE NECESSARY; AND FIXING THE TERMS AND
CONDITIONS THEREOF.”
